00:27:12,610 --> 00:27:14,950
这样它们就变成超越雄性的主宰。
and they will become dominant over the male.

490
00:27:15,380 --> 00:27:19,920
弗里曼：合趾猿和黑猩猩的基因几乎是相同的,
Freeman: Bonobos and chimps are genetically almost identical,

